OL,3,GNEWSACharity tea room may close despite
OL,4,ALudwig filming
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tea room is temporarily closed
OL,7,Funtil 7 October while filming takes
OL,8,Fplace for Ludwig; its frontage has been
OL,9,Ftransformed to resemble a bank, which
OL,10,Fit was before becoming a community
OL,11,Fvenue.
